shimeji2 is an altered version of Shimeji.

This program is a Rust rewrite of Shimeji for Mac (shimeji4mac) and of the
original Shimeji by group-finity. It is not the original software. Do not
represent shimeji2 as the original Shimeji, Shimeji for Mac, or shimeji4mac.

The original zlib/libpng notice is reproduced below, unaltered. It applies to
the original program and to the bundled shime assets copied from it. See
NOTICE.md and assets/packs/shime/ATTRIBUTION.md.

